              "text": "The most famous and iconic version of the song \"All I Want for Christmas Is You\" is sung by **Mariah Carey**, who co-wrote and released it in 1994. \n\nHowever, there is also another very popular, completely different Christmas song with the exact same title:\n* **Vince Vance & the Valiants** released a country-pop song called \"All I Want for Christmas Is You\" in 1989 (sung by Lisa Layne). \n\nIf you are thinking of the massive, chart-topping holiday pop hit, that is **Mariah Carey**. Other artists have also covered her version over the years, including **Michael Bubl\u00e9** and a duet version featuring **Justin Bieber**.",
